@startuml Sistema de Órdenes - Ecommerce AstroCore

actor Usuario as U
participant Frontend as F
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant OrderController as OC
participant "Use Cases" as UC
participant OrderRepository as OR
participant CartRepository as CR
participant ProductRepository as PR
participant Database as DB

== Crear Orden desde Carrito ==
U -> F: Clic "Proceder al checkout"
F -> API: POST /api/orders\n{shippingAddressId, notes}
API -> Auth: Verificar JWT token
Auth --> API: userId extraído
API -> OC: createOrder(req, res)
OC -> UC: CreateOrderUseCase.execute()
UC -> CR: CartRepository.getCartItems(userId)
CR -> DB: SELECT cart_items JOIN products
DB --> CR: Items del carrito
CR --> UC: CartItems con productos
UC -> UC: Validar carrito no vacío
UC -> UC: Calcular subtotal, IVA, envío, total
UC -> UC: Generar orderNumber único
UC -> OR: OrderRepository.create()
OR -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
OR -> DB: INSERT INTO orders
OR -> DB: INSERT INTO order_items (múltiples)
OR -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> OR: Orden creada
OR --> UC: Order completa
UC -> CR: CartRepository.clearCart(userId)
CR -> DB: DELETE FROM cart_items
UC --> OC: Order
OC --> API: 201 {order}
API --> F: Orden creada
F --> U: "Orden #12345 creada exitosamente"

== Listar Órdenes del Usuario ==
U -> F: Ver "Mis pedidos"
F -> API: GET /api/orders?page=1&limit=10
API -> Auth: Verificar token
Auth --> API: userId
API -> OC: getOrders(req, res)
OC -> UC: GetOrdersUseCase.execute()
UC -> OR: OrderRepository.findByUserId()
OR -> DB: SELECT orders JOIN order_items JOIN products
DB --> OR: Órdenes con items
OR --> UC: Orders[]
UC --> OC: Orders paginadas
OC --> API: 200 {orders, pagination}
API --> F: Lista de órdenes
F --> U: Mostrar historial de pedidos

== Obtener Orden Específica ==
U -> F: Clic en orden específica
F -> API: GET /api/orders/order_123
API -> Auth: Verificar token
API -> OC: getOrderById(req, res)
OC -> UC: GetOrderByIdUseCase.execute()
UC -> OR: OrderRepository.findById()
OR -> DB: SELECT order JOIN items JOIN products JOIN address
DB --> OR: Orden completa con detalles
OR --> UC: Order detallada
UC -> UC: Verificar ownership (userId)
UC --> OC: Order
OC --> API: 200 {order}
API --> F: Detalles de la orden
F --> U: Ver estado, items, dirección, totales

== Actualizar Estado de Orden (Admin) ==
participant Admin as A
A -> F: Cambiar estado de orden
F -> API: PUT /api/orders/order_123/status\n{status: "SHIPPED"}
API -> Auth: Verificar token + rol admin
Auth --> API: userId + isAdmin
API -> OC: updateOrderStatus(req, res)
OC -> UC: UpdateOrderStatusUseCase.execute()
UC -> OR: OrderRepository.findById()
OR --> UC: Verificar orden existe
UC -> OR: OrderRepository.updateStatus()
OR -> DB: UPDATE orders SET status, updatedAt
DB --> OR: Orden actualizada
OR --> UC: Order
UC --> OC: Order
OC --> API: 200 {order}
API --> F: Estado actualizado
F --> A: "Estado cambiado a SHIPPED"

== Validaciones y Reglas de Negocio ==
note over UC
- Carrito no puede estar vacío
- Productos deben estar activos
- Verificar stock disponible
- Calcular IVA (15% Ecuador)
- Generar orderNumber único
- Estados válidos: PENDING → CONFIRMED →
  PROCESSING → SHIPPED → DELIVERED
- Solo admin puede cambiar estados
- Usuario solo ve sus propias órdenes
end note

@endum